OL,3,GNEWSAThe farmers who fought the
OL,4,Aplanners and won
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo farmers have been describing the
OL,7,F"absolutely exhausting" process of
OL,8,Ftaking on States of Guernsey planners
OL,9,Fto get a development overturned.
OL,11,FFiona Pollock and Jason Brache
OL,12,Fsuccessfully got plans to build 14 new
OL,13,Fhomes on land bordering their farm in
OL,14,Fthe Vale quashed by a judicial review.
OL,16,F"The celebration was a coffee and a
OL,17,Fcake and that was it. Because it's not
OL,18,Fa celebration, it's ongoing." Brache
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
