OL,3,GNEWSAThe farmers who fought the
OL,4,Aplanners and won
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning was found to have not followed
OL,7,Fits own guidelines, by not properly
OL,8,Fconsidering the impact on protected
OL,9,Fbuildings in the vicinity of the site.
OL,10,FThe Development and Planning Authority
OL,11,F(DPA) says it has altered some of its
OL,12,Fprocesses following the judicial
OL,13,Freview.
